   - **ONGOING**: GPS0 on boot until mode switch — most likely GPS cold start (30–60 sec). Survey mode is entered and left during this period; the mode switch triggers immediate render which coincides with GPS acquiring fix. The status bar auto-updates every 1000ms, so without mode switch it would also update within 1 second of fix acquisition.
